l shader uniform in a tex blit shader, the shader will fail to compile with this error.\n\n```\nE 0:00:00:354   instance.gd:12 @ _ready(): TexBlitShaderGLES3: Fragment shader compilation failed:\n0:88(19): error: syntax error, unexpected '['\n\n  <C++ Source>  drivers/gles3/shader_gles3.cpp:262 @ _display_error_with_code()\n  <Stack Trace> instance.gd:12 @ _ready()\n```\n\nThis happens because we forgot to add support for it. So the global buffer is not present, nor is the name of the global buffer passed to the shader compiler. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nPR incoming\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nIt will be less work for me to make a PR than an MRP","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124337/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124337/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}